@* 勾選後浮在畫面底部的操作列：第一行顯示數量、第二行是功能按鈕；不佔版面，出現時不會把列表往下推 *@
@if (Count > 0)
{
    <div class="selection-bar card">
        <div class="selection-count">已選取 @Count 筆</div>
        <div class="selection-actions">@ChildContent</div>
    </div>
}

@code {
    [Parameter] public int Count { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public RenderFragment? ChildContent { get; set; }
}
